+|---|---|---|
+| `app/page.tsx` | Lines 63–71 | Headline rotator pause/play state, `prefers-reduced-motion` check, 4.5s cadence |
+| `app/page.tsx` | Lines 218–275 | Canonical `categoriesList` keys, authentic deliverable descriptors |
